  "notes": "\n1. Filtered the AED locations to include only the four specified districts (Songshan, Xinyi, Da'an, and Zhongshan) using `prep.in_area` with the provided '區域代碼' column.\n2. Excluded records where '場所分類' is '學校、大型集會場所' or '其他'.\n3. Deduplicated locations using `prep.merge_same_place` to ensure that multiple AEDs at the same venue are treated as a single site.\n4. To satisfy the hard constraint that each of the 4 teams must have an identical number of sites, the total number of sites N was adjusted to be a multiple of 4 by randomly removing the remainder (N % 4) using a fixed seed for reproducibility.\n5. Computed the pairwise straight-line distance matrix using `prep.haversine_matrix`.\n",
